# IMX round 2: Table lite on Tracker+, panel keys only. plus_flows.sh loads the setup after the boot project load (poke file "pat" lines):
# the last used instrument Synth 1 (64), table 1 at tic 4, Loop, 4 rows of transpose 0 +2 -1 +1. Pattern, Rec on, hold Note and let go
# (the note popup puts the last used note of Synth 1 on the step), hold Fx, Down to "Table" (list position 52 on Tracker+ and Mini), let go:
# the step gets TBL 1. Rec off, Play runs the step: the table of track 1 starts on Synth 1 and walks its rows, Play again stops it.
# Ends on the poke read (UISHOT_TRACE_TABLES): track 1 ran table 1 on instrument 64 from row 0 into a later row, and the runner is off at the end
title: Table lite TBL step FX on Tracker+ (IMX round 2)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
tap Rec
wait 600ms
press Note
wait 1000ms
release Note
wait 800ms
press Fx
wait 1200ms
tap Down x52
wait 800ms
shot tables-list
release Fx
wait 800ms
expect text "Y - Table"
tap Rec
wait 600ms
tap Play
wait 2500ms
shot tables-play
tap Play
wait 800ms
